# Go Blank: "Target player discards two cards. Then exile that player's graveyard." Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Ornithopter on
# turn 3, so Bot2 already has a graveyard card, then casts Go Blank on Bot2. Bot2 chooses Mountain and Forest to discard
# (CR 701.9); the graveyard exiled afterwards holds Ornithopter and those two (CR 406.2): all three are in exile and the
# graveyard is empty, so the discards were exiled too, not only the earlier card. Bot1's own graveyard (Bolt, Go Blank) stays.

